    },
    "q-82252": {
      "dom_id": "step-q82252",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "By changing the order of integration in the following double integrals, express the following sum as a single double integral.\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14154008/assets/20055a4c35ca0fdcb119e69118861d9139d23f404ecb530cf7c1b9ecf39a96d6.png)\n\nThe diagram above shows the region of integration. It consists of two type I regions, given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{x}\\}\\,\\cup \\,\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,1\\le x\\le 2,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{2-x}\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the left boundary of the region, written in the form $y=y(x),$ is\n\n$$\ny=\\sqrt{x}\\,⟹\\,x={y}^{2}\n$$\n\nand the right boundary of the region is\n\n$$\ny=\\sqrt{2-x}\\,⟹\\,x=2-{y}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTo change the order of integration we write $D$ as a type II region. The type II representation of the region is\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,{y}^{2}\\le x\\le 2-{y}^{2}\\},\n$$\n\nas shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14154008/assets/77dda47f9036b7019f0d2ea5d72c1b81e5778e5d7108760a3b0394a213690304.png)\n\nTherefore, swapping the order of integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{y}^{2}}^{2-{y}^{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82252-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\int }_{0}^{{y}^{2}}{\\int }_{2-{y}^{2}}^{1}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y",
